WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.134 --> 00:00:03.036
-We're hanging out
with Jon Hamm!

00:00:03.036 --> 00:00:04.737
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:04.737 --> 00:00:06.038
The greatest.

00:00:06.038 --> 00:00:08.340
His new movie,
"No Sudden Move,"

00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:12.512
begins streaming on HBO Max
on July 1st.

00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:14.547
And now Jon and I
are about to go head-to-head

00:00:14.547 --> 00:00:16.949
in a game of
egg Russian roulette.

00:00:16.949 --> 00:00:19.351
Higgins, would you like
to explain how this works?

00:00:19.351 --> 00:00:21.887
-[Speaking evilly]
Yes, James!

00:00:21.887 --> 00:00:25.959
Here in my hands
I have one dozen eggs.

00:00:25.959 --> 00:00:27.227
Four thrice.

00:00:27.227 --> 00:00:28.628
Eight of them --

00:00:28.628 --> 00:00:30.396
[ Laughter ]

00:00:30.396 --> 00:00:31.798
-Four thrice. Yeah.
-Okay.

00:00:31.798 --> 00:00:33.133
-Eight of them --
-Keep going.

00:00:33.133 --> 00:00:34.901
-That is two and four --
have been hard-boiled.

00:00:34.901 --> 00:00:38.371
Four of them...are still raw!

00:00:38.371 --> 00:00:40.840
You and Jon shall take turns

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:43.710
selecting an egg
and smashing it upon your head.

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:45.411
You won't know
which eggs are raw

00:00:45.411 --> 00:00:47.280
and which ones are hard-boiled.

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:49.682
But once you choose an egg,
you must smash that egg!

00:00:49.682 --> 00:00:51.550
-Should you be in a costume
or something?

00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:52.951
-I know.

00:00:52.951 --> 00:00:55.054
Acting. Know what I mean?

00:00:55.054 --> 00:00:56.823
-Can we put it back?
-Yeah.

00:00:56.823 --> 00:00:58.791
No. You may not. No putbacks.
-Okay!

00:00:58.791 --> 00:01:00.393
-Can we take two?
-No, you may not.

00:01:00.393 --> 00:01:02.995
Wh-one egg! Wh-one egg!

00:01:02.995 --> 00:01:06.499
Either r-r-raw or hard-buhled.

00:01:06.499 --> 00:01:08.834
As a guest of the show, Jon,

00:01:08.834 --> 00:01:11.938
you shall proceed
with the prima ovum.

00:01:11.938 --> 00:01:14.473
The first egg.

00:01:14.473 --> 00:01:16.209
-The prima ova. [ Laughs ]

00:01:16.209 --> 00:01:18.511
-Which one shall you choose?

00:01:18.511 --> 00:01:20.046
-Primum ovum?

00:01:20.046 --> 00:01:22.248
-Prima! Prima ovum.

00:01:22.248 --> 00:01:24.951
[ Laughs evilly ]

00:01:28.387 --> 00:01:30.223
-How do you feel -- Ooh.

00:01:30.223 --> 00:01:32.658
[ Gasps ] Oh! The spin trick!

00:01:32.658 --> 00:01:34.961
Wait. I feel good
about that one.

00:01:34.961 --> 00:01:37.163
[ Laughter ]

00:01:37.163 --> 00:01:42.668
♪♪

00:01:42.668 --> 00:01:45.971
-You were so confident!
You were so confident!

00:01:45.971 --> 00:01:48.340
You were so confident!
-[ Laughs evilly ]

00:01:48.340 --> 00:01:50.543
-You were so confident,
and you -- you were acting.

00:01:50.543 --> 00:01:52.945
-The yoke's on you, Mr. Hamm!

00:01:52.945 --> 00:01:54.380
[ Chortling ]

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:59.185
James! I hope you don't
get egg on your...shirt.

00:01:59.185 --> 00:02:01.020
-Oh, boy.

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:02.722
-I like what you --
I see what you did there.

00:02:02.722 --> 00:02:04.557
I see what you did there.
-Oh! That one?

00:02:04.557 --> 00:02:07.292
Mistake. Mm, yes.

00:02:07.292 --> 00:02:08.560
-I feel good about it.

00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:11.097
-Buena fortun-a-a-a-a!

00:02:11.097 --> 00:02:12.531
-Solid. Solid.

00:02:12.531 --> 00:02:14.333
-It's a solid one.
-Solid. I can see it.

00:02:14.333 --> 00:02:17.436
-I can feel it. Thanks.
It has a sheen to it.

00:02:17.436 --> 00:02:19.305
-Well. Charlie or Martin?

00:02:19.305 --> 00:02:21.440
-Um -- [ Laughs ]

00:02:21.440 --> 00:02:24.276
UH, Emilio.
-Emilio Estevez.

00:02:24.276 --> 00:02:26.078
-There you go.

00:02:26.078 --> 00:02:30.149
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:30.149 --> 00:02:33.552
Sheens all over. [ Laughs ]

00:02:33.552 --> 00:02:35.421
Ooh. Nice selection there.

00:02:35.421 --> 00:02:36.956
-I shall not look.

00:02:36.956 --> 00:02:39.425
-No, you can look, Higgins.
It doesn't matter if you see it.

00:02:39.425 --> 00:02:41.226
-Pick an egg.

00:02:41.226 --> 00:02:43.629
There are still three raw eggs.

00:02:43.629 --> 00:02:45.765
-Jon, if you pick --
-Ohh!

00:02:45.765 --> 00:02:48.567
-My hand's all eggy.

00:02:48.567 --> 00:02:50.102
It's slippery.

00:02:50.102 --> 00:02:51.537
-There you go. Good luck.

00:02:51.537 --> 00:02:53.539
That served you well last time.

00:02:53.539 --> 00:02:54.941
-Wow.
-Ohh!

00:02:54.941 --> 00:02:59.212
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:59.212 --> 00:03:02.782
-I learned that
from Encyclopedia Brown.

00:03:02.782 --> 00:03:04.751
-Oh! That's the movie --

00:03:04.751 --> 00:03:08.621
-Lower the air in the tires,
and you can get an inch.

00:03:08.621 --> 00:03:10.690
Good luck, James. Good luck!

00:03:10.690 --> 00:03:14.193
-He's confident.
The confidence is solid.

00:03:14.193 --> 00:03:17.062
You feel it. I feel good.

00:03:17.062 --> 00:03:20.366
-Hey, come on, kid. Let's play
catch around the backyard.

00:03:20.366 --> 00:03:24.837
[ Talking over each other ]

00:03:26.306 --> 00:03:27.440
-Wow.

00:03:27.440 --> 00:03:31.010
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:31.010 --> 00:03:32.344
Getting to be a pro at this.

00:03:32.344 --> 00:03:35.181
-You are batting a thousand.
-I am batting a thou.

00:03:35.181 --> 00:03:36.682
-Three remain...

00:03:36.682 --> 00:03:37.917
-[ Shudders ]

00:03:37.917 --> 00:03:39.852
-...unfettered by heat.

00:03:39.852 --> 00:03:41.954
Raw in the st-- Oh.

00:03:41.954 --> 00:03:44.223
♪♪

00:03:44.223 --> 00:03:45.524
-I'm not gonna spin it.

00:03:45.524 --> 00:03:46.759
-You're not?
-No.

00:03:46.759 --> 00:03:48.661
-All right.
But it looks like you are.

00:03:48.661 --> 00:03:49.995
-Well, I'm not.
-All right.

00:03:49.995 --> 00:03:52.031
-I mean, I might roll it.
-Okay.

00:03:52.031 --> 00:03:53.732
And what were you doing --
Like, "Ehh..."

00:03:53.732 --> 00:03:55.868
[ Speaking gibberish ]

00:03:55.868 --> 00:03:58.037
Hah!
-Ohh!

00:03:58.037 --> 00:04:03.108
[ Bell dinging ]

00:04:03.108 --> 00:04:05.044
-Thank you so much for --

00:04:05.044 --> 00:04:07.213
[ Laughter ]

00:04:07.213 --> 00:04:10.350
Thank you so much
for coming on the show.

00:04:10.350 --> 00:04:12.184
Jon Hamm! He's unbelievable!

00:04:12.184 --> 00:04:14.721
That's --
[ Cheers and applause ]

